# The private instance's build-time overrides (rpg.jamesonrgrieve.ca, CT 7103; the operator, 2026-11-23:
# "rpg.jamesonrgrieve.ca will have all AI providers as system level for all users"). Sourced after
# deploy.env, so a client built for it has its own public origin inlined, never prod's: a client built
# from deploy.env alone signs in and sets its CSP origin as rpg.zephyrex.ai.
APP_URI=https://rpg.jamesonrgrieve.ca
